			"notes": "## Fixes\n- Keep reconnecting spectators in spectator mode until their spectate session is restored or ended. The bug made the spectator in survival mode for seconds which could get them into trouble. The bug was triggered on a modded server by another mod installed; the specific mod is unconfirmed.\n- Wait half a second before switching to the target's POV when starting or restoring a spectate session, avoiding camera timing issues.\n- Active spectate sessions now end and restore the player’s saved state when they lose permission to spectate the target, instead of leaving them in spectator mode stuck.\n- `/spectate <player>` now rejects targets who are spectating or have a reconnecting session pending.\n- Spectate sessions now end when the target player starts spectating another player.\n\n## Changes\n- Reduce reconnect session restoration delay from five seconds to three seconds.\n\n## Improvements\n- Add a clickable chat button and `/spectate pov` command to return from freecam to the target's POV; clients do not need AdminScope installed.\n- Made `/spectate stop` clickable in the session hint.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Abdo9616/AdminScope-mod/compare/0.7.1-Alpha+26.2...0.7.3-Alpha+26.3"
		},
